WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:02.890
Delete one sentence from your vocabulary:

2
00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:04.290
that can't be done.

3
00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.510
I point to a founder who
doesn't seem to have it.

4
00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:09.920
Told something is impossible, he asks:

5
00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:11.140
why not?

6
00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:13.060
And then he keeps asking.

7
00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:15.020
My question for you:

8
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.800
are you repeating your goal,

9
00:00:18.265 --> 00:00:19.650
with positive emotion,

10
00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:20.640
every day?

11
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.220
Or does it still feel unfamiliar?

12
00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:27.250
A million in six months feels like
a threat when it's unfamiliar.

13
00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.930
After six months of
picturing it in detail,

14
00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:31.350
it feels possible.

15
00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:34.720
We build thought habits
the way we build any habit.

16
00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:36.080
Specific.

17
00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:37.600
Measurable.

18
00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:39.080
Repeated.

19
00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:40.790
Write one goal.

20
00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:42.820
Say it every day this week.

21
00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.290
Then write what in your week
doesn't line up with it.
